message: "If you use, adapt or refer to Sloplab, please cite it as below."
title: "Sloplab: A specimen bench for AI-generated interface design, 2023–2027"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kocaballi
    given-names: Baki
    affiliation: "Human-AI Futures Lab, University of Technology Sydney"
version: "2.0"
date-released: 2026-10-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/abakik/sloplab"
url: "https://github.com/abakik/sloplab"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  An interactive specimen bench for the default look of AI-generated
  interfaces from 2023 to 2026, organised by colour, typography, component,
  composition, imagery, motion, interaction and copy, with evidence-tagged
  traits and a driver-based forecast for 2027.
keywords:
  - AI slop
  - generative AI
  - interface design
  - design trends
  - human-AI interaction
